征东大将军曹休、抚军大将军司马宣王〖5〗，并受遗诏，辅嗣主。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":488,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":64,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-b-e28c5cd47fe98ad60171","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-e28c5cd47fe98ad60171","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：黄初六年（公元 225）。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":467,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-61512c4ade75d71d6a76","start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o049","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-d5847039c2d504d36e8e","layer":"original","quote":"六年春二月〖1〗，遣使者循行许昌以东，尽沛郡〖2〗。问民所疾苦，贫者赈贷之。﹝一﹞三月，行幸召陵〖3〗，通讨虏渠〖4〗。乙巳〖5〗，还许昌宫。并州刺史梁习讨鲜卑轲比能〖6〗，大破之。辛未〖7〗，帝为舟师，东征。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":461,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":105,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o054","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-19250f15bc304637f90e","layer":"original","quote":"七年春正月，将幸许昌。许昌城南门，无故自崩；帝心恶之，遂不入。壬子〖1〗，行还洛阳宫。三月，筑九华台〖2〗。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":487,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":54,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
